Additionally, I can reproduce the issue on a M5 MacBook Air.\n```\nGodot Engine v4.7.1.stable.mono.official.a13da4feb - https://godotengine.org\nMetal 4.0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M5 (Apple9)\n```\nSetting `Driver.macos` to `vulkan` corrects the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5235215554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5236381351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120496#issuecomment-5236381351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496","id":5236381351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOBzWpw","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T05:47:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T05:47:54Z","body":"3 reports confirm on M5, with 2 disconfirming reports on M1 and M4, so this does seem like something specific with the M5 generation of chips - have marked as confirmed but this could be difficult to figure out if there isn't a contributor with the correct hardware","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5236381351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5298717652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120496#issuecomment-5298717652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496","id":5298717652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO9QD1A","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T22:18:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T22:18:32Z","body":"I don't have any M5 hardware to validate and fix this issue (M1 and M4 only)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5298717652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5353985235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120496#issuecomment-5353985235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496","id":5353985235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPx9U0w","user":{"login":"cosformula","id":18232501,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjMyNTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18232501?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula","html_url":"https://github.com/cosformula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cosformula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T09:24:27Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T16:19:58Z","body":"I took a look into this and noticed a potential cause: the voxelization shader updates `render_geom_facing` using [`imageAtomicOr()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5d63a641c79b5fb83e8d6752864c739f3254d720/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl#L2937-L2941), but [`gi.cpp` creates the texture without `TEXTURE_USAGE_STORAGE_ATOMIC_BIT`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5d63a641c79b5fb83e8d6752864c739f3254d720/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/gi.cpp#L454-L459).\n\nBisecting between `4.4.1-stable` (working) and `4.5-stable` (broken) led to commit [`5230f6c60c`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/5230f6c60c28b1a34fb0136f84aa901afe382f39) in PR #108028 (*\"Apple: Use image atomic operations on supported Apple hardware\"*):\n\n- **Before #108028**: The Metal driver automatically added `MTLTextureUsageShaderAtomic` to any texture whose pixel format supported atomics.\n- **After #108028**: It only sets `MTLTextureUsageShaderAtomic` when `TEXTURE_USAGE_STORAGE_ATOMIC_BIT` is explicitly requested. Volumetric fog textures were updated with this bit, but `render_geom_facing` was missed.\n- Vulkan storage images and D3D12 UAV textures implicitly permit atomics, but Metal strictly requires [`MTLTextureUsageShaderAtomic`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/mtltextureusage/shaderatomic). Without it, atomic operations on Apple9 fail silently.\n\n\nAdding the missing usage flag in `gi.cpp`:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/gi.cpp b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/gi.cpp\n@@ -454,6 +454,8 @@\n \t\ttf_render.format = RD::DATA_FORMAT_R32_UINT;\n+\t\ttf_render.usage_bits |= RD::TEXTURE_USAGE_STORAGE_ATOMIC_BIT;\n \t\trender_geom_facing = create_clear_texture(tf_render, \"SDFGI Render Geometry Facing\");\n+\t\ttf_render.usage_bits &= ~RD::TEXTURE_USAGE_STORAGE_ATOMIC_BIT;\n```\n\nTested on an Apple M5 Max and it solve the issue.\n\n*(Note: It's still unclear why Apple7 / M1 was more forgiving and tolerated the missing flag).*\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5353985235/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5363084335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120496#issuecomment-5363084335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496","id":5363084335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP6osLw","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T22:59:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T22:59:05Z","body":"@cosformula is correct – great find!\n\n- #122675","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5363084335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]